<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY NET FOREIGN DEBT UP AT $12.87 BLN IN DEC.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY NET FOREIGN DEBT UP AT $12.87 BLN IN DEC.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's net foreign debt</p>
<p>stood at 12.87 billion in December, slightly up from 12.57</p>
<p>billion in November, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said in</p>
<p>a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    FIGURES IN  MILLION	Dec 1996	Nov 1996</p>
<p>    Net foreign debt	     12,870.0	12,565.8</p>
<p>International reserves and</p>
<p>     other foreign assets	13,388.5	13,821.5</p>
<p>    Gross foreign debt	   26,258.5	26,387.3</p>
<p>Net foreign debt of the</p>
<p>     government and NBH	   7,907.6	 8,241.3</p>
<p>    NOTE: Debt figures exclude inter-company loans.   ((  --</p>
<p>Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040 ))</p>
</text>
